ll the fowls of the mountains: and the wild beasts of the field are mine.", "words": [[0, 59651], [2, 59782], [7, 60002], [11, 60322], [15, 60442], [21, 60922], [24, 61042], [28, 61122], [39, 62328], [43, 62438], [47, 62518], [52, 62818], [59, 63218], [62, 63458], [66, 63558], [72, 63878], [76, 64058]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 65342, "end": 70580, "text": "If I were hungry, I would not tell you: for the world is mine, and the fulness of it.", "words": [[0, 65342], [3, 65484], [5, 65644], [10, 65784], [18, 66524], [20, 66624], [26, 66744], [30, 66924], [35, 67184], [40, 68123], [44, 68186], [48, 68286], [54, 68526], [57, 68706], [63, 69046], [67, 69406], [71, 69596], [79, 69786], [82, 70106]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 71030, "end": 74371, "text": "Will I eat the flesh of bulls, or drink the blood of goats?", "words": [[0, 71030], [5, 71152], [7, 71312], [11, 71512], [15, 71652], [21, 71852], [24, 72052], [31, 72552], [34, 72812], [40, 73032], [44, 73192], [50, 73412], [53, 73532]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 74821, "end": 79122, "text": "Offer to God thanksgiving; and pay your vows to the most High:", "words": [[0, 74916], [6, 75036], [9, 75216], [13, 75396], [27, 76870], [31, 77014], [35, 77234], [40, 77374], [45, 77814], [48, 77994], [52, 78134], [57, 78274]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 79572, "end": 84577, "text": "And call upon me in the day of trouble: I will deliver you, and you shall glorify me.", "words": [[0, 79572], [4, 79716], [9, 79916], [14, 80156], [17, 80476], [20, 80636], [24, 80716], [28, 80896], [31, 80996], [40, 82052], [42, 82159], [47, 82279], [55, 82619], [60, 83099], [64, 83199], [68, 83299], [74, 83439], [82, 83919]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 84927, "end": 92179, "text": "But to the wicked God says, What have you to do to declare my statutes, or that you should take my covenant in your mouth?", "words": [[0, 84927], [4, 85057], [7, 85177], [11, 85297], [18, 85557], [22, 85997], [28, 86981], [33, 87147], [38, 87267], [42, 87487], [45, 87707], [48, 8796